# This repo intentionally tracks ONLY the code files.
# The CAIN rulebook PDFs/plaintext, the generated notes, and the reference
# image assets are deliberately left untracked (large, mostly third-party
# material). Whitelist approach: ignore everything, then re-include code.

# Ignore everything at the root by default...
/*

# ...but keep the code files and this ignore list.
!.gitignore
!talismains.html
!open-talismains.command
